{
  "case_id": "SELECTOR-KEYS-1.21.1",
  "title": "目标选择器强力胶式按键语义：左键=确认 / 右键=自用不可用提示（不提交）/ 右键+潜行=取消 / ESC 菜单=取消 / J=取消（保留），选择期间滚轮拦截与 ChatScreen 豁免不变",
  "version": "1.21.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "glue-selector-keys"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "被测语义(2026-09-17 用户裁决,Create 强力胶式交互;本模组全部技能不开放自身使用):①左键 = 确认目标(发 TargetSelectConfirmPayload);②右键 = 对自身使用 ⇒ 只弹 actionbar「该技能无法对自己使用」,**不提交选择**(会话保留);③右键+潜行 = 取消;④ESC 菜单(ScreenEvent.Opening 收到 PauseScreen)= 取消;⑤J(主动技能键)= 取消(保留);⑥选择期间滚轮拦截、ChatScreen 豁免(命令注入)均保留。旧口径(Enter 确认键 / 键盘拦截 Mixin)已删除。"
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "证据口径(全部经日志,无须新探针):①四种输入的区分靠固定格式调试行 `[Astral Dice][TargetSelectPrompt] key=left|right|right_sneak|esc action=…`(DEBUG ⇒ 落 **debug.log**,故 source=debug);②「右键不提交」由**反证**给出 —— 若右键误走确认,会话当场结束,紧随其后的左键确认会因 token 失效打出 `[TargetSelection] confirm FAIL` ⇒ 断言 absent `confirm FAIL` 且 present 左键 confirm SUCCESS;③左键确认与三次取消的服务端落账分别锚 `[TargetSelection] confirm token=.. -> SUCCESS` 与 `[TargetSelection] cancel token=.. player=`(同一 debug.log);④ESC 用例结束时再按一次 ESC 关菜单,随后以 /astralprobe diag SK 证明客户端已恢复(latest.log 的 AP_SK_DIAG: 行)。actionbar 文案与这些调试行的对应关系:self_unsupported→msg.astral_dice.target_select.self_unsupported、no_target→…no_target、cancelled→…cancelled、默认常驻提示→…active。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode creative"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/time set midnight"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/kill @e[type=minecraft:husk]"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0"
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "摆靶:超平坦世界 + yaw=0/pitch=0(面向 +Z 平视)后在正前方 4 格召唤**不会昼燃**的敌对生物 husk(NoAI 静止、静音、不自然消失)⇒ 准星射线命中它,与会话 targetType=ENEMY(test_echo_enemy)匹配,距离 4 ≤ 服务端半径 16。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/summon minecraft:husk ^ ^ ^4 {NoAI:1b,Silent:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b}"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "① 右键(不潜行)= 自用不可用提示、**不提交**;随后用一条聊天命令重新瞄准(顺带证明选择期间 ChatScreen 豁免:会话没被命令聊天取消),再左键确认。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astral_dice targetselect enemy"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_mouse",
      "button": "right"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_mouse",
      "button": "left"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1000
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "② 右键+潜行 = 取消(服务端 `cancel token=.. player=`)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astral_dice targetselect enemy"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_mouse",
      "button": "right",
      "shift": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1000
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "③ J(主动技能键)= 取消(保留项;走 KeyMapping 消费,不再需要键盘拦截 Mixin)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astral_dice targetselect enemy"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_key",
      "key": "j"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1000
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "④ ESC = 原版照常打开暂停菜单,菜单一打开即取消选择(`key=esc action=cancel`);再按一次 ESC 关菜单,并用探针命令证明客户端已恢复(菜单关掉、命令通道可用)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astral_dice targetselect enemy"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_key",
      "key": "cancel"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_key",
      "key": "cancel"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe diag SK"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
